; refuse: --fault=thunk-in-slot --read-core tests/hs/core/lib/base.core | lint after mid: internal compiler error: the value of
; rhc's mutant of Core to Mid, a thunk in a typed slot (the roadmap's rhc's
; mutants): a suspension given where its value is wanted, unforced. Tier 2
; trusts a typed slot, so the VM would read it blind (E2); MidLint, which
; holds a suspension's type apart from its value's, refuses it at the
; boundary into Mid.
(val main (-> World (utuple World Unit))
  (\ ((w World))
    (let (x Int (prim int_add 1 2))
      (printInt x w))))
